Description: Interactive STEM education for Vietnamese pupils (NEO One)
 NEO STEM is an open-source interactive STEM education application for
 Vietnamese pupils (grades 3-9), built for the NEO One education device
 (ARM64/Armbian) and standard Linux desktops.
 .
 The app is a PyQt6 + QML front end with a Python backend that tracks
 progress and badges in a local SQLite database. PyQt6, the Qt6 QML
 runtime (QtQuick, QtQuick.Controls, QtMultimedia) and the GStreamer
 media plugins are pulled from apt (never built via pip).
